&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A demonstrated track record of selling high-dollar marketing/advertising services over the phone&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a short sales cycle, one-call close experience is a big plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3–5 years of Business Development, Inside Sales, or Account Executive experience with a tech company serving brick-and-mortar customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full fluency in Spanish and English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive drive, optimism, and confidence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated proficiency in prospecting and hunting for new clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to sell to busy, no-nonsense business owners while still building relationships built to last&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resourcefulness and adaptability, you find creative solutions even when they&#39;re not “how it&#39;s done” in this space&lt;/li&gt;
